  "limits": [
    "VM tests use four CPUs, normal flat topology and explicit one-package/two-core/two-thread geometry. No new physical R4OS boot, AMD/hybrid/hotplug/over32-CPU acceptance.",
    "The actual decoder independently matches eight native Intel Linux CPU sysfs geometries and caches; that is decoder evidence, not a native R4OS catalog boot.",
    "AMD legacy physical SMT interpretation is family17h+ and TopologyExtensions gated; older CMT and undocumented vendors use unknown fallback.",
    "No NUMA, physical capacity score or preferred-core performance is inferred from topology, cache sharing or raw core class.",
    "Scheduler policy remains flat here. Placement/cache/hysteresis and the lower0.85.9 scheduler observation belong to0.85.11. No unchanged-artifact benchmark repetition or stable speedup claim."
  ]
